# Tribunal "Dark Brotherhood Attacks": dbAttackScript rolls on every sleep
# (20-90% by level) and sends assassins; the first one's death logs 10
# (db_assassinScript). A guard's greeting names Apelles Matius in Ebonheart
# (30; the greeting without the dart, an authored path); Apelles names Asciene
# Rane (50), whose transport (choice 1) sends the player to the Royal Palace
# (60, MHTransportScript). A Royal Guard names the sewers (100).
# The player sleeps in the unowned bed in Ebonheart's Underground Caves; the
# rats are killed first, and `defend` stands in for the fight. The roll is
# random (20% a sleep at level 1), so `rest` sleeps an hour at a time until the
# first assassin's death logs 10 (60 sleeps leave a 1-in-650,000 miss). Ref
# FormIDs carry Morrowind.esm's slot 05 and Tribunal.esm's slot 06.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_co_estate --timeout 2400
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tr_dbattack
run
player->PositionCell -210 1800 760 0 "Ebonheart, Underground Caves"
until 300 GetPCCell "Ebonheart, Underground Caves" == 1
console 05624BA5.kill
console 05A43F8A.kill
console 0553AEE8.kill
defend
wait 60
rest 60 05554237 GetJournalIndex TR_DBAttack >= 10
run
player->Position 13831 -101615 760 0
talk 05533705
expect GetJournalIndex TR_DBAttack == 30
bye
run
player->Position 13612 -100323 1200 0
until 600 "apelles matius"->GetDistance player < 400
talk apelles matius
ask Dark Brotherhood
ask the mainland
ask Asciene Rane
expect GetJournalIndex TR_DBAttack == 50
bye
run
player->PositionCell 1271 550 -123 0 "Ebonheart, Grand Council Chambers"
until 600 "asciene rane"->GetDistance player < 400
talk asciene rane
ask transport to Mournhold
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TR_DBAttack == 60
bye
until 600 GetPCCell "Mournhold, Royal Palace: Reception Area" == 1
talk 06A948E5
ask Dark Brotherhood
expect GetJournalIndex TR_DBAttack == 100
bye
end
